{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"ja","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-3024020","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-3024020-handbook-monster-3024020-0","text":"「星核ハンター」の一員、重装甲を纏った謎の戦士。彼の鉄甲は灼熱の炎を放ち、戦場を火の海に変え、烈火の如き攻撃を仕掛けることができる。","speaker":""}]}
